[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3031871681","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108220#issuecomment-3031871681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108220","id":3031871681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60trDB","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T11:09:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T11:10:42Z","body":"This sounds like a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100673, cc @RandomShaper ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3031871681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032229237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108220#issuecomment-3032229237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108220","id":3032229237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60vCV1","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T13:14:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T13:16:09Z","body":"Thinking a little about this, i dont really want to duplicate the PackedScene, only my parent resource (that is saved to disk)\n\nI can workaround this issue using `@export_custom` to add the `PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE` flag to my PackedScene\nproperty\nBut i have a couple personal questions on the topic:\n\n- Should `PackedScene` always have the `PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE` flag built from the engine?\n- There could be an extra annotation to allow making this workaround more easily:\n```\nclass_name MyResource extends Resource\n@never_duplicate\n@export var my_scene: PackedScene\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032229237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033109655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108220#issuecomment-3033109655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108220","id":3033109655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60yZSX","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T18:01:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T18:01:33Z","body":"I can confirm this prevented the issue:\n```\n@export_custom(\n\tPROPERTY_HINT_RESOURCE_TYPE,\n\t\"PackedScene\",\n\tPROPERTY_USAGE_DEFAULT | PROPERTY_USAGE_SCRIPT_VARIABLE | PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE)\nvar my_scene: PackedScene\n```\ni needed to dig a little to find the default usage for packed scene to append \"never duplicate\" tho","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033109655/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]